    &lt;li&gt;\({@a2@}\) rounded to 3 decimal places becomes \( {@ta2@}.\)&lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;\({@a3@}\) rounded to 3 decimal places becomes \( {@ta3@}.\)&lt;/li&gt;
